# Image build context: the Dockerfile only needs go.mod, go.sum, vendor/,
# cmd/, internal/ and kafkabeat.example.yml. Everything else (git repository,
# binaries, bench, acceptance tests, real configuration with credentials) stays
# out of both the context sent to the daemon and the build cache.
.git
.github
bin
dist
bench
recette
kibana
deploy
plans
*.md
*.state
*.state.tmp
state
kafkabeat.yml
